	// `reason` is optional and is stored on the row. It is **not** in the
	// `identity.api_key.revoked` event: nobody typed it consistently, it is not a
	// fact about the credential, and a field whose values vary per operator is one
	// every consumer learns to ignore.
	//
	// Takes any type of body and a specified content type.
	//
	// Corresponds with DELETE /v1/accounts/{account_id}/api-keys/{key_id} (the `RevokeAPIKey` operationId).
