	// DeleteSession Log out
	//
	// Revokes the session the presented credential names, and clears the
	// session cookie. The token stops working on both surfaces immediately: a
	// `GET /v1/me` with the revoked token is a 401 on the cookie and on the
	// bearer header alike.
