	// this name is a 409, because "revoke ci-deploy" is otherwise ambiguous and an
	// operator picking the wrong one leaves a credential live they believe they
	// have destroyed. The constraint is on LIVE tokens only, so rotation is two
	// requests — revoke, then mint the same name — and not a transaction that has
	// to find a name free first.
